        "reply_count": 3,
        "retweet_count": 28
      },
      "text": "Advice for folks who do too much math and too little physics:\n\nDon’t try to be too clever.\n\nCleverness often comes with complexity and increased execution risk.\n\nOftentimes the less optimal yet simpler solutions are the best ones in a paradigm of finite time and resources.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1233810953088557056"
    },
