        "quote_count": 1,
        "reply_count": 3,
        "retweet_count": 27
      },
      "text": "First and primary role about competition: don’t focus on competitors.\n\nEither you will accomplish something meaningfully better than them through original insight, or you will always be stuck in a zero sum game.",
