      "text": "The *best* feeling is talking to someone who is able to articulate ideas that ring absolutely true to you, but you weren't able to put into words.\n\nIt pulls the idea from a set of loosely tied patterns in a rough direction to a clear, communicable thought.\n\nThese people \"get it.\"",
