      },
      "text": "If you want to be a historian, go into finance.\n\nIf you want to write the future, go to a startup.\n\nFinanciers study the ideas that already exist and pick the profitable ones. They study how things have been done already, and cap their imagination.\n\nStartups invent the future.",
